                  Parameters for POSTSIM
                  **********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
sgsim.out                        \file with simulated realizations
2                                \   number of realizations
-1.0e21   1.0e21                 \   trimming limits
50   50   1                      \nx, ny, nz
postsim.out                      \file for output array(s)
1   0.5                          \output option, output parameter
